racefuncenter` -> 3), then 8 concurrent processes per round x 6 rounds, ALL pinned to
two CPUs via `taskset -c 0,1` on a 32-core box (~16x oversubscription under -race):
  -> CONTENDED_RESULT: PASS=48 FAIL=0 of 48
Total 88/88. `grep -l "DATA RACE" /tmp/r10run.*.log /tmp/r10c.*.log` -> RACE_REPORTS_FOUND=0.
The `-run 'InBrowser|Consequences'` selector was verified to match exactly the 8 new
tests and nothing else (grep of ^func Test across the package -> count 8), and the
